  "readmeFile": "PACKAGE_README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.10.0-alpha.12: Author-period manifests now produce one-command calendar-month, calendar-week, or custom multi-contributor comparison reports as versioned JSON, trend Markdown, or anonymized engineering-findings Markdown, with optional capacity ratios, up to 64 repositories, resumable digest-bound checkpoints, and explicit incomplete-failure output. Closed-month portfolio analysis no longer stalls on overlapping first-parent lineages, rebinds reused evidence to exact row scopes, preserves root pipeline errors, and keeps logical-capability ranges ordered. Repository EHE remains experimental and uncalibrated, and seed-rules/0.4.0 remains the shipped estimator. Full notes: https://github.com/VictorZakharov/efforthours/blob/v0.10.0-alpha.12/CHANGELOG.md",
